# Declining the microphone keeps the draft and sending: the app says where to
# allow it, nothing records, and the draft sends. The driver declines for the
# user, whose system prompt a scenario cannot reach.
# iOS: testSimulatorDictationPermissionDenialPreservesDraftAndSend
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[immediate] Keep this draft after microphone denial"
microphone deny
press 音声をCodexで文字起こし
expect "マイクへのアクセスを許可してください" 10000
screenshot denied
press 閉じる
expect_absent "マイクへのアクセスを許可してください" 10000
expect_absent 録音を取り消す
expect "Keep this draft after microphone denial"
press 送信
expect "シミュレータで完了しました。" 30000
